---
---

<section class="py-20 px-4">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto">
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
            <div class="order-2 md:order-1">
                <span
                    class="text-primary font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-sm mb-4 block"
                >
                    Our Mission
                </span>

                <h2
                    class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-black text-slate-900 uppercase mb-6 leading-tight"
                >
                    Make Every Space <br /> Work Better
                </h2>

                <div
                    class="space-y-4 text-slate-600 leading-relaxed font-medium"
                >
                    <p>
                        Findable Home helps renters and homeowners find practical
                        ways to organize their spaces, reduce clutter, and make
                        everyday routines easier.
                    </p>

                    <p>
                        We focus on useful storage ideas for kitchens, bathrooms,
                        closets, laundry areas, and other spaces where room is
                        limited. Our approach prioritizes realistic solutions,
                        including renter-friendly options that do not require
                        permanent changes.
                    </p>

                    <p>
                        Our goal is to help you make thoughtful choices, use the
                        space you already have, and find products that solve real
                        household problems without encouraging unnecessary
                        purchases.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="order-1 md:order-2 relative">
                <div
                    class="aspect-square rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl"
                >
                    <img
                        src="/images/hero/hero-home.webp"
                        alt="Organized, comfortable living space"
                        class="w-full h-full object-cover hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-700"
                        loading="lazy"
                    />
                </div>

                <div
                    class="absolute -bottom-6 -right-6 w-32 h-32 bg-primary/10 rounded-full -z-10 blur-2xl"
                ></div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
